  "description": "Saddle up your designs with Western Whiskey, a rugged display font that captures the bold, untamed spirit of the Old West. Featuring sharp, spurred serifs and a powerful slab-style structure, this “Italic Style” variant adds a dynamic sense of motion and grit to your headlines. Its classic frontier aesthetic is perfect for craft brewery labels, vintage-inspired saloon posters, barber shop branding, and apparel design. Whether you’re aiming for a high-noon standoff or a weathered, rustic look, Western Whiskey delivers a timeless, masculine character that stands tall in any territory.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Saddle up your designs with Western Whiskey, a rugged display font that captures the bold, untamed spirit of the Old West. Featuring sharp, spurred serifs and a powerful slab-style structure, this “Italic Style” variant adds a dynamic sense of motion and grit to your headlines. Its classic frontier aesthetic is perfect for craft brewery labels, vintage-inspired saloon posters, barber shop branding, and apparel design. Whether you’re aiming for a high-noon standoff or a weathered, rustic look, Western Whiskey delivers a timeless, masculine character that stands tall in any territory.</p>",
